 "name": "Trend Intensity Index (M. H. Pee): cruzamento dos níveis extremos",
 "family": "tendencia",
 "sources": [
  "https://www.traders.com/Documentation/FEEDbk_docs/2002/06/Abstracts_new/Pee/pee.html",
